#: processes/log-message.bpmn:62
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "An incomplete message is NOT logged and the actor says it could not log. A log line missing its actor or its task reads as a record while answering nothing, and a reader cannot tell it from a complete one. Silence is recoverable; a misleading entry is not."
msgstr ""

#: processes/log-message.bpmn:47
#. Diagram label
msgid "Compose the message"
msgstr ""

#: processes/log-message.bpmn:48
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Five required strings — timestamp, actor, process, task, message — and one optional markdown body. The five are required because each answers a question a reader of the log will otherwise have to guess, and a guessed answer in a log is worse than a missing one."
msgstr ""

